OL,3,GNEWSACare home rated inadequate again
OL,4,Aamid safety fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care home that was placed in special
OL,7,Fmeasures has again been rated as
OL,8,Finadequate after it had not done enough
OL,9,Fto "ensure people received consistently
OL,10,Fsafe and effective care".
OL,12,FThe Care Quality Commission (CQC) found
OL,13,Fthat Ashley Court Care Ltd in
OL,14,FWolverhampton remained in breach of six
OL,15,Fregulations related to safe care and
OL,16,Ftreatment, staffing, dignity and
OL,17,Frespect, person-centred care, need for
OL,18,Fconsent and overall management of the
OL,19,Fservice.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
