OL,3,GNEWSACare home rated inadequate again
OL,4,Aamid safety fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe site, on Penn Road, was first
OL,7,Fdowngraded from "requiring improvement"
OL,8,Fto "inadequate" in March.
OL,10,FA spokesperson for the home said it was
OL,11,F"disappointed" with the new rating and
OL,12,Fstaff remained "committed to
OL,13,Fcontinuously improving the care we
OL,14,Fprovide".
